{"id":"cloze","name":"cloze","aliases":[],"caption":"A LuaLaTeX package for creating cloze texts","authors":[{"id":"friedrich","active":true}],"copyright":[{"owner":"Josef Friedrich","year":"2015-2025"}],"license":"lppl1.3c","version":{"number":"2.0.0","date":"2025-07-04"},"descriptions":[{"language":null,"text":"<p>\n      This is a LuaTeX or LuaLaTeX package for generating cloze texts.\n      The main feature of the package is that\n      the formatting doesn’t change when using \n      the <tt>hide<\u002ftt> and <tt>show<\u002ftt> options.\n    <\u002fp>\n  <p>\n      There are the commands <tt>\\cloze<\u002ftt>, <tt>\\clozefix<\u002ftt>,\n      <tt>\\clozefil<\u002ftt>, <tt>\\clozenol<\u002ftt>, <tt>\\clozestrike<\u002ftt>\n      and the environments <tt>clozepar<\u002ftt> and <tt>clozebox<\u002ftt> to\n      generate cloze texts.\n    <\u002fp>"}],"documentation":[{"language":null,"details":"Package documentation","href":"ctan:/macros/luatex/generic/cloze/cloze-doc.pdf"},{"language":null,"details":"Readme","href":"ctan:/macros/luatex/generic/cloze/README.md"}],"bugs":"https://github.com/Josef-Friedrich/cloze/issues","repository":"https://github.com/Josef-Friedrich/cloze","development":"https://josef.friedrich.rocks","ctan":{"path":"/macros/luatex/generic/cloze","file":true},"miktex":"cloze","texlive":"cloze","topics":["exam","luatex"]}